SUMMARY:The Setup: Speakeasy Comedy New York LIVE at ReVision Lounge and Gallery
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nThe Setup: Speakeasy Comedy New York transforms ReVision Lounge and Gallery into a close-quarters comedy secret in the heart of the Lower East Side. Comics seen on Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central deliver close-range punchlines in an intimate\, low-lit setting unlike any other in NYC. \nWith shifting lineups and a singular East Village atmosphere — bathtub couches\, bike-chain lights\, and brick walls — every show is a one-of-a-kind experience built for lasting memories. \nEvent Details\nDate: July 18\, 2026 (additional dates available — select during purchase)\nTime: Doors open at 6:30 PM; Show starts at 7:00 PM\nVenue: ReVision Lounge and Gallery\nAddress: 219 Avenue B\, New York\, NY 10009\nCity: New York\, NY\nPrice: $15.00\nAge Restriction: 21 and over with valid ID\nDuration: 2 hours \nAbout the Venue\nReVision Lounge and Gallery is a unique Lower East Side bar and gallery space in the East Village. The venue features eclectic décor including bathtub couches\, instrument lights\, and recycled-money bar details\, creating a hidden\, speakeasy-like atmosphere perfect for intimate live comedy. \nWhat to Expect\nArrive early to grab drinks and claim prime general-admission seats before the show begins. The Setup NYC features a rotating lineup of comics with credits from Netflix\, HBO\, and Comedy Central performing in an unusually close setting where every punchline lands with maximum impact. \nThe intimate format and unique venue design make this one of New York City’s most memorable comedy experiences. Note: the venue is not wheelchair accessible. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Fever. General Admission is $15.00. A 2-for-1 ticket option may also be available. All sales are final. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/the-setup-speakeasy-comedy-new-york-live-at-revision-lounge-and-gallery/
LOCATION:ReVision Lounge and Gallery\, 219 Avenue B\, New York\, NY\, 10009\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/f74eb54c-6cfd-11f1-8cc2-3aa0170c6417.jpeg
GEO:40.728901;-73.978213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=ReVision Lounge and Gallery 219 Avenue B New York NY 10009 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=219 Avenue B:geo:-73.978213,40.728901
END:VEVENT
