SUMMARY:Marc Maron: Yammering into the Void Tour LIVE at Rialto Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nMarc Maron is a legendary stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcaster whose raw\, confessional style has earned him a devoted following over three decades in comedy. Best known as the host of the massively influential WTF with Marc Maron podcast\, Maron has also starred in the critically acclaimed IFC series Maron and appeared in numerous films and TV shows. \nHis stand-up is deeply personal\, brutally honest\, and darkly funny — exploring themes of anxiety\, addiction\, relationships\, and the absurdity of modern life. Maron has released several acclaimed Netflix specials including Too Real\, End Times Fun\, and From Bleak to Dark\, each showcasing his evolution as a storyteller and comedian. \nThe Yammering into the Void Tour promises all-new material from one of comedy’s most authentic and compelling voices. If you appreciate comedy that makes you think as much as it makes you laugh\, this is the show for you. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Rialto Theatre\, 318 Congress St\, Tucson\, AZ 85701\nTicket Price Range: $61 – $364\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Rialto Theatre is one of Tucson’s most beloved and historic entertainment venues\, located in the vibrant downtown arts district on Congress Street. Originally built in 1920\, the Rialto has been beautifully restored and now serves as a premier mid-size venue with a capacity of approximately 1\,300 guests. \nThe venue features a general admission floor area\, reserved balcony seating\, and excellent acoustics that make every performance feel intimate and immersive. The Rialto’s historic architecture — with its ornate details and warm lighting — creates a truly special atmosphere for live comedy and music events. \nStreet parking and nearby parking garages are available in the downtown area. The venue is surrounded by great restaurants and bars\, making it easy to turn the evening into a full night out in Tucson’s lively downtown scene. \nWhat to Expect\nMarc Maron’s Yammering into the Void Tour is a solo stand-up performance featuring brand-new material. Expect Maron’s signature stream-of-consciousness storytelling\, sharp cultural observations\, and deeply personal confessions delivered with his trademark intensity and wit. \nThe show runs approximately 75–90 minutes. Maron’s performances are known for their conversational intimacy — even in a packed venue\, it feels like he’s talking directly to you. This is a rare opportunity to see one of comedy’s most respected voices perform live in an intimate setting. \nDoors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early to grab a drink at the bar and soak in the Rialto’s historic atmosphere before the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $61 to $364 depending on seat location. Official tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are available through VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/marc-maron-yammering-into-the-void-tour-live-at-rialto-theatre/
LOCATION:Rialto Theatre-Tucson\, 318 Congress St\, Tucson\, AZ\, 85701\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://a.vsstatic.com/mobile/app/theater/marc-maron.jpg
GEO:32.2215888;-110.9664973
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Rialto Theatre-Tucson 318 Congress St Tucson AZ 85701 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=318 Congress St:geo:-110.9664973,32.2215888
END:VEVENT
