SUMMARY:Andrew Schulz LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nAndrew Schulz LIVE at Brea Improv\nOne of the most influential voices in modern comedy\, Andrew Schulz brings his fearless\, unfiltered stand-up to the Brea Improv for two shows on July 18\, 2026. \nHis Netflix special LIFE spent 15 consecutive days in the U.S. Top 10 and appeared in the Top 10 across 13 countries. This is a rare intimate club performance from a comedian who regularly sells out arenas. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Andrew Schulz\nAndrew Schulz is a New York-native comedian whose Netflix special LIFE became a global hit in 2025. He sold out Madison Square Garden twice\, headlined the Kia Forum and Crypto.com Arena\, and his podcast Flagrant has crossed 1.4 billion total views on YouTube. He is known for his bold\, unfiltered comedy that covers politics\, pop culture\, and everything in between. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFearless\, unfiltered stand-up from a Netflix and arena headliner\nSharp commentary on culture\, politics\, and everyday life\nA rare intimate club performance from a major comedy star\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\nTwo shows available — early and late\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets are sold out. Resale tickets available on VividSeats from $184. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-schulz-live-at-brea-improv/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23_Edp-lmRkNR.png
GEO:33.9183365;-117.8988084
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Brea Improv 180 South Brea Blvd Brea CA 92821 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=180 South Brea Blvd:geo:-117.8988084,33.9183365
END:VEVENT
