SUMMARY:SO LIT Saturday Blackbird Ordinary Comedy Night
DESCRIPTION:So Lit Saturday: nonstop comedy\, guaranteed seating\, shots\, and a Miami afterparty that keeps the night alive. Free Shots at 9PM.\n\n\nSO LIT Saturday at Blackbird Ordinary 🔥\n \nHere’s how to start off your Saturday nights…in one of the best nightclubs in Brickell. \nWe’re setting the weekend on fire with comedy\, cocktails\, and crowdwork\, all happening inside Blackbird Ordinary\, Miami’s most iconic nightlife spot. \n🎤 Comedy Show | 9–10:30PMThe night kicks off in the back room\, where it transforms into a full-blown comedy club. Hosted by Manny Garavito (Miami’s Best Comedian) and JJ (Manny’s favorite Miami comedian)\, expect laughs that go from wild to wild af real quick. \nThese two have spent years building Miami’s funniest nights\, and now they’re bringing the energy\, the people\, and the afterparty vibes all under one roof. \nTicket Options \nFree SeatingFirst come\, first served. Whatever seats are not purchased will be available to anyone who arrives early. Once they’re gone\, they’re gone. \n$25 Guaranteed Seating + FREE Shot After 9pmSecure your spot without rushing. We’ll hold your seats until you arrive and welcome you with your shot even if you show up after 9 PM. Limited seating available. \n$50 VIP Experience (Guaranteed Seating\, FREE Shot After 9PM\, VIP Bottle Afterparty Access AND Merch)Everything included: guaranteed seating\, a free shot even after 9 PM\, access to our bottle section for the afterparty with Manny and JJ\, plus exclusive Miami Comedy merch to take home. VERY Limited space. \n \nThis is So Lit Saturday at Blackbird Ordinary—where Brickell weekends hit different.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/so-lit-saturday-blackbird-ordinary-comedy-night-22/
LOCATION:Blackbird Ordinary\, Southwest 1st Avenue 729\, Miami\, FL\, 33130\, United States
CATEGORIES:Showcase
