DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nAries Spears LIVE at Funny Bone – Omaha\nDon’t miss the final show of Aries Spears’ Omaha engagement as this stand-up comedy powerhouse closes out his weekend run at Funny Bone Comedy Club. Known for his razor-sharp wit and explosive energy\, Aries Spears delivers a comedy experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 19\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors open at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Funny Bone Comedy Club\, 710 N 114th St\, Suite 210\, Omaha\, NE 68154\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his long run on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impressions made him a household name. With decades of experience on stage and screen\, Spears brings a high-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every performance. He has appeared on numerous TV specials and continues to tour nationally to sold-out crowds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a MADtv legend\nHilarious celebrity impressions and sharp observational humor\nAn intimate comedy club atmosphere\nFull bar and dinner menu available\nThe final show of the weekend – don’t miss your last chance!\n\nTicket Information\nTickets for the Sunday 6:00 PM show start at $37. Seating is general admission. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
