SUMMARY:Joey Avery LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Joey Avery\nJoey Avery is a stand-up comedian known for his energetic delivery\, sharp observations\, and engaging crowd work. His comedy blends personal storytelling with clever cultural commentary\, delivered with a charismatic style that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nHe has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, building a dedicated fanbase through his relatable and consistently funny material. Fans can expect a high-energy\, entertaining evening of stand-up comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern California’s most celebrated comedy destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way\, this intimate club has been a cornerstone of the Sacramento comedy scene for decades\, hosting legends and rising stars alike. \nThe venue features general admission and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, and the classic two-drink minimum. The cozy room ensures every audience member gets an up-close\, personal experience. Parking is available in the adjacent shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline stand-up performance by Joey Avery. Expect a fun\, high-energy evening of stand-up comedy with sharp observations and engaging crowd interaction. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. The 18+ policy and beverage minimum are in effect. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $52 – $75 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/joey-avery-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/92fc9dde-d495-4d5f-a295-e594e797b110_CUSTOM-sIq7d4.jpg
