SUMMARY:DoKnow LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nDoKnow is a dynamic and energetic stand-up comedian who has been making waves in the comedy world with his high-energy performances and infectious personality. Known for his quick wit\, clever wordplay\, and ability to connect with audiences of all backgrounds\, DoKnow delivers comedy that is both entertaining and thought-provoking. \nWith a growing national profile and a dedicated fanbase\, DoKnow has been steadily building his reputation as one of the most exciting voices in contemporary stand-up comedy. His live shows are known for their unpredictability\, audience engagement\, and non-stop laughs from the moment he hits the stage. This performance at Cobb’s Comedy Club is a must-see for comedy fans in the Bay Area. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, July 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open earlier)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person\n\nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club has been a cornerstone of San Francisco’s entertainment scene for decades. Located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the iconic North Beach neighborhood\, the club is surrounded by great restaurants\, bars\, and the vibrant energy of one of SF’s most beloved districts. \nThe venue accommodates approximately 400 guests in a classic comedy club setup with general admission seating. Tables and chairs are arranged to give every guest a great view of the stage\, and the intimate size of the room ensures a personal\, connected experience between performer and audience. A full bar is available\, and the two-beverage minimum per person applies to all shows. \nParking can be found on nearby streets and in garages throughout the North Beach area. Plan to arrive at least 20 minutes before showtime to find parking and get comfortable. The venue is also accessible via BART and Muni bus lines. \nWhat to Expect\nDoKnow’s live show is a high-energy\, laugh-filled experience from start to finish. His comedy style blends personal storytelling with sharp observations about everyday life\, pop culture\, and social dynamics. Expect a comedian who is fully in command of the stage and committed to giving the audience the best possible show. \nThe performance runs approximately 75-90 minutes and is recommended for adult audiences. DoKnow’s natural charisma and comedic instincts make every show feel fresh and spontaneous. Whether you’re a longtime fan or seeing him for the first time\, this is a Sunday night comedy experience you won’t want to miss. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $32.05 (General Admission\, includes fees). Seating is general admission — first come\, first served within sections. Tickets are non-refundable and non-exchangeable. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/doknow-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/878/1c017ade-58b3-4815-9226-a58d2c49d878_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
