SUMMARY:Mark Schiff LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMark Schiff is a veteran stand-up comedian with over four decades of experience making audiences laugh across the country. A close friend and frequent collaborator of Jerry Seinfeld\, Mark is widely respected in the comedy world for his clean\, clever\, and deeply relatable humor. \nHis comedy draws from real life — family\, relationships\, aging\, and the absurdities of everyday existence — delivered with the kind of warmth and precision that only a true comedy craftsman can achieve. Mark has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Late Night with David Letterman\, and numerous other television programs\, and has released multiple acclaimed stand-up specials. \nSeeing Mark Schiff live at the Laugh Factory in Las Vegas is a treat for fans of classic\, well-crafted stand-up comedy. His shows are consistently funny\, heartfelt\, and leave audiences feeling genuinely uplifted. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 20\, 2026 (runs through July 22)\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the iconic Horseshoe Hotel and Casino at 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, this club is part of the legendary Laugh Factory brand that has been a cornerstone of American stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe venue features tiered seating with excellent sightlines\, a full-service bar\, and an intimate atmosphere that puts you close to the action. The Laugh Factory’s rotating roster of headliners ensures there’s always something new and exciting to see\, making it a must-visit for comedy fans on the Strip. \nParking is available at the Horseshoe Las Vegas parking garage. The venue is conveniently located on the Strip and easily accessible from surrounding hotels and attractions. \nWhat to Expect\nMark Schiff’s Las Vegas engagement at the Laugh Factory is a multi-night stand-up showcase featuring his signature blend of clean\, observational humor and personal storytelling. Expect an evening of genuine laughs delivered by one of comedy’s most respected veterans. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and may include an opening act. Mark’s warm stage presence and masterful timing create an atmosphere that feels both intimate and electric. This is the kind of comedy show that reminds you why live stand-up is one of the greatest forms of entertainment. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $55 (fees may apply) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official). Don’t miss your chance to see a comedy legend live in Las Vegas! \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-schiff-live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7ed77c01-a1f5-4d0d-9243-cbc0a49daafa_CUSTOM-q7Gv63.jpg
GEO:36.112302;-115.1674427
